msgstr "Tetapan Semasa"

#: kmldonkey/setupwizard.cpp:182
msgid "<h1>Name Your Core</h1><p>The last thing you need to do is assign a name to your core. This is for your own use only; the default \"MLDonkey\" is quite adequate, but you can choose anything you like.</p>"
